# ===========================================
# 📝 NOTES
# ===========================================
#
# - Copy this file to .env.local for local development
# - Use Xendit TEST MODE keys (not production keys!)
# - All REACT_APP_* variables are exposed to the browser
# - Backend variables (without REACT_APP_) are only available server-side
# - For Vercel Dev to work, you need both frontend and backend variables
#
